OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA band of rain, locally
OL,6,Fheavy, clears shortly after dawn.
OL,7,FCloud breaks with isolated heavy
OL,8,Fshowers developing later. Remaining
OL,9,Fwindy with coastal and hill gales
OL,10,Fdeveloping. A further mild day.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,13,FGenerally dry and partly cloudy on
OL,14,FWednesday but remaining windy. Cloudy,
OL,15,Fwet and windy through Thursday. Drier
OL,16,Fand brighter on Friday, winds easing.
OL,17,FMild through much of the period.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
